    "false_friends": "\"realize\" in everyday English means *come to understand*. Similar words in many languages mean *carry out* or *make*. English uses **realize** in that sense mainly in formal English, with dreams, hopes, ambitions, and plans; for an ordinary task, English says **do**, **complete**, or **carry out**.",
